// Sum of the winning labeled hammings strictly above the smallest kept hamming.
// One hamming returns nothing. A greater hamming is added again when repeated.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE hasum ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG hasum rank

IMPULSE hasum 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "hasum" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
